  "sourceFindings": [
    "Published .166 history inserts raw row.text and computes raw offsets; fixed history renders assistant Markdown using the same projection as live output and calculates rendered lengths.",
    "Both mergeHistory restart recovery and replaceHistory browsing use ChatTranscriptRendering. Canonical source and row identities stay separate from display.",
    "ChatHistoryView, MarkdownLite and SessionTranscriptPage are unchanged between the .166 tag and fix; no newer alternate recovery route was found.",
    "All three product rendering files and two unit-test files exactly match the fix commit. The sixth file, Verify01HostJourney.java, subsequently gained diagnostic collection in 6217c89ac4c7735c5f9e08bc01ea885bde14a0b3; that evaluator change is not required to ship the rendering correction."
  ],
